(friends cheering)

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:24.443
- That was...

00:08:24.443 --> 00:08:25.310
I was convinced.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:26.143
- She legit looks like a mermaid.

00:08:26.143 --> 00:08:29.000
- This is the weirdest moment
of our friendship for sure.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.443
You're welcome Quinta.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:31.729
- Hi, how's it going?

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.300
- Come sit by me so you can use the...

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:34.133
(laughs)

00:08:34.133 --> 00:08:35.350
- [Quinta] Didn't we
always see her as this?

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:36.480
- [Female Friend] Yeah, Ella is a mermaid.

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:38.220
I always thought of her as
like a fair or a mermaid.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:39.053
- [Quinta] True, true.

00:08:39.053 --> 00:08:40.500
It really does feel like
I'm at the aquarium.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.750
(laughter)

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:45.223
- Oh splash zone!

00:08:45.648 --> 00:08:46.827
We're in the splash zone!

00:08:46.827 --> 00:08:47.660
(applause and cheering)

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:48.547
- [Male Friend] Yay Ella!

00:08:48.547 --> 00:08:50.778
- [Female Friend] Sapphire!

00:08:50.847 --> 00:08:52.610
- So, you learned a new hobby today.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:53.513
We had some ups and downs.
- I did.

00:08:53.513 --> 00:08:55.770
I think I was having like, a little ego,

00:08:55.770 --> 00:08:58.340
and I was nervous of like, looking dumb.

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:00.173
But once I got in that tail.

00:09:00.490 --> 00:09:01.350
- That was a game-changer.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:02.663
The second you pulled up that tail,

00:09:02.663 --> 00:09:05.120
you literally got into character.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:07.250
- I'm gonna be honest, it
was really, really fun.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.271
I had a blast.

00:09:08.271 --> 00:09:09.104
- [Kate] You looked like
you were having so much fun.

00:09:09.104 --> 00:09:11.300
- And I have been really
stressed out lately,

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:14.163
working so much so, you
know what, thank you Kate.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:15.640
This was really, really good.

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:16.473
- Oh my god!

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:20.140
So, would you say it was, Worth It?

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:20.990
I'm just kidding.

00:09:21.244 --> 00:09:22.077
(laughter)

00:09:22.077 --> 00:09:24.120
- This was definitely a unique hobby.

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:27.500
But this really reminded me
to have a little bit more fun

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.493
and take stuff less seriously.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:32.450
I can't believe it took you
and these three mermaids

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:33.803
to remind me of that.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:34.713
- Wow.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:37.483
Change is possible, kids.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:39.100
- [Ella] I know this sounds silly,

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:40.500
but I did have a great time.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:42.540
- What a day, what a whirlwind.

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:43.373
- Fun.

00:09:43.533 --> 00:09:46.450
- It was fun and she ended
up having fun and liking it.

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:48.010
- [Steven] So what have
we learned from this?

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:50.760
- [Kate] I learned that I
should put on more sunscreen.

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:52.450
- Hey Unsolved is on a new channel,

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:53.350
and now your part.

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:54.203
- [Together] Subscribe here.

00:09:54.203 --> 00:09:55.203
- That was my part.

